#: toplevel.cpp:58
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The application finder looks for non-KDE applications on your system and "
"adds them to the KDE menu system. Click 'Scan' to begin, select the desired "
"applications and then click 'Apply'."
msgstr ""
"Die soeker kyk vir Nie-KDE programme op jou stelsel en voeg hulle by die Kde "
"kieslys stelsel. Kliek 'Skandeer' om te  begin, kies die verlangde programme "
"Kliek dan 'Pas Toe'."

